      "content": "I understand how you feel, but ending your life isn't the answer. It's a temporary solution that won't bring you the peace you're looking for. Instead, maybe it's time to find a way to reconnect with the person you once were. You don't have to be defined by the pain and suffering you're experiencing right now. There are people who care about you and want to help, even if it's hard to see right now. Maybe it's time to reach out and let them in, even if it feels like they're the last ones standing. You deserve to live, even if it feels like you're walking through a fog.",
      "source": "target",
